## Anti-Patterns

❌ **Using Options API for new code**
```vue
<script>
export default {
  data() { return {}; },
  methods: {},
}
</script>
```

✅ **Use Composition API**
```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
const data = ref({});
function method() {}
</script>
```

❌ **Mixing v-for and v-if**
```vue
<div v-for="item in items" v-if="item.active">
```

✅ **Filter first, then loop**
```vue
<div v-for="item in activeItems">
```

❌ **Not using keys**
```vue
<div v-for="item in items">
```

✅ **Always use unique keys**
```vue
<div v-for="item in items" :key="item.id">
```

